<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang='vi'>
<head>
<meta charset='utf-8'>
<meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1,maximum-scale=1,user-scalable=no,viewport-fit=cover'>
<meta name='mobile-web-app-capable' content='yes'>
<title>Survivalcraft 2 — Web Clone</title>
<style>
/* ==========================================================================
   [CSS] Survivalcraft 2 - "rounded shapes" 2.4 visual language
   ========================================================================== */
*{box-sizing:border-box;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none}
html,body{margin:0;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#0a0e13;color:#eaf2ff;
  font-family:'Trebuchet MS',Verdana,system-ui,sans-serif}
#c{position:fixed;inset:0;display:block;touch-action:none}
.hidden{display:none!important}
.screen{position:fixed;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  z-index:60;overflow:hidden}

/* ---------------- Main menu + parallax ---------------- */
#mainMenu{background:linear-gradient(#4f9ee0,#bfe4ff 55%,#ffeec2)}
#mainMenu .sky{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(#2f7fc8,#83c2ee 55%,#d9edff);z-index:-4}
#mainMenu .clouds{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:4%;height:40%;z-index:-3;opacity:.9;
  background-image:radial-gradient(closest-side,#fff 96%,transparent),radial-gradient(closest-side,#fff 96%,transparent),radial-gradient(closest-side,#fff 96%,transparent);
  background-size:190px 62px,250px 74px,150px 52px;background-repeat:repeat-x;
  background-position:0 0,320px 46px,660px 12px;animation:drift 70s linear infinite}
@keyframes drift{from{background-position:0 0,320px 46px,660px 12px}
  to{background-position:1400px 0,1720px 46px,2060px 12px}}
.hill{position:absolute;bottom:-16vh;border-radius:50% 50% 0 0;z-index:-2}
.h1{left:-25%;width:95%;height:50vh;background:#7cb862;opacity:.65}
.h2{left:20%;width:85%;height:42vh;background:#63a04f;opacity:.85}
.h3{left:62%;width:75%;height:34vh;background:#4f8a42}
.h4{left:5%;width:110%;height:20vh;background:#3f7437;z-index:-1}
#logo{margin-bottom:18px;font-size:min(11vw,58px);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:3px;color:#fff;
  text-shadow:0 3px 0 #2c5d8e,0 6px 0 #1f4570,0 10px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.35);text-align:center;line-height:1}
#logo span{display:inline-block;background:#ffd34d;color:#5a3b00;border-radius:12px;padding:0 10px;margin-left:8px;
  box-shadow:inset 0 -4px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.18)}
.menuBtns{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center}
.btn{min-width:250px;padding:13px 26px;margin:6px;border:none;border-radius:18px;cursor:pointer;
  font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#1d3247;font-family:inherit;
  background:linear-gradient(#ffffff,#cfe1f3);box-shadow:0 4px 0 #9db4cd,0 9px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.22);
  transition:transform .05s,box-shadow .05s}
.btn:active{transform:translateY(3px);box-shadow:0 1px 0 #9db4cd,0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.25)}
.btn.small{min-width:120px;font-size:16px;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:14px}
.btn.warn{background:linear-gradient(#ffd9d9,#f2b3b3);color:#5a1b1b;box-shadow:0 4px 0 #c98b8b}
.ver{position:absolute;bottom:10px;font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.85);text-shadow:0 1px 2px #000}

/* ---------------- Generic panel ---------------- */
.panel{background:linear-gradient(rgba(28,42,58,.97),rgba(18,28,40,.97));border-radius:26px;padding:18px;
  box-shadow:0 14px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.55),inset 0 0 0 3px rgba(255,255,255,.10);max-width:96vw;max-height:92vh;overflow:auto}
.panel h2{margin:2px 0 14px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;color:#cfe6ff;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1px}
.row{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;align-items:center}

/* ---------------- HUD ---------------- */
#hud{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:20;pointer-events:none}
#hud .rbtn,#hud .pad,#hud #hotbar,#hud #miniWrap{pointer-events:auto}
#bars{position:absolute;top:8px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);display:flex;gap:14px}
.iconRow{display:flex;gap:1px}
.iconRow img{width:20px;height:20px;image-rendering:pixelated;filter:drop-shadow(0 1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,.6))}
#meters{position:absolute;top:34px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);display:flex;gap:10px}
.meter{width:130px}
.meter b{display:block;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1px;opacity:.85;text-align:center;margin-bottom:2px}
.track{height:9px;border-radius:6px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.45);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(255,255,255,.15)}
.track i{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:6px;width:50%;transition:width .25s}
#tempFill{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5bc8ff,#ffb35b,#ff5b5b)}
#energyFill{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#7dff8a,#ffe45b)}
#debug{position:absolute;top:8px;left:8px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.45;font-family:monospace;
  text-shadow:0 1px 2px #000;background:rgba(0,0,0,.30);padding:6px 9px;border-radius:12px;white-space:pre}
#miniWrap{position:absolute;top:8px;right:8px;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;
  box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.5),inset 0 0 0 3px rgba(255,255,255,.18);background:#20303f}
#minimap{display:block;width:112px;height:112px;image-rendering:pixelated}
#crosshair{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:22px;height:22px;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);opacity:.9}
#crosshair:before,#crosshair:after{content:'';position:absolute;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 0 2px #000}
#crosshair:before{left:50%;top:0;width:2px;height:100%;margin-left:-1px}
#crosshair:after{top:50%;left:0;height:2px;width:100%;margin-top:-1px}
#hotbar{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:10px;transform:translateX(-50%);display:flex;gap:5px;
  background:rgba(12,20,30,.62);padding:6px;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(255,255,255,.14)}
.slot{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.10);position:relative;
  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(255,255,255,.16);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.slot.sel{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 3px #fff,0 0 12px rgba(255,255,255,.5)}
.slot img{width:36px;height:36px;image-rendering:pixelated}
.slot .cnt{position:absolute;right:3px;bottom:1px;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;text-shadow:0 1px 2px #000}
.slot .lbl{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:-14px;text-align:center;font-size:9px;opacity:.75}
#leftBtns,#rightBtns{position:absolute;bottom:76px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
#leftBtns{left:10px}
#rightBtns{right:10px}
.rbtn{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:#eaf6ff;background:linear-gradient(rgba(70,105,140,.72),rgba(38,60,84,.72));
  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(255,255,255,.28),0 5px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.4);cursor:pointer}
.rbtn:active{transform:scale(.93);background:linear-gradient(rgba(120,165,205,.9),rgba(60,90,120,.9))}
.pad{position:absolute;bottom:70px;width:132px;height:132px;border-radius:50%;
  background:radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.10),rgba(0,0,0,.22));
  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 3px rgba(255,255,255,.22);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
#padLeft{left:14px}
#padRight{right:14px}
.pad .knob{width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(#f2f9ff,#a8c4dc);
  box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.45);transition:transform .04s}
#toast{position:absolute;left:50%;top:62%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:rgba(0,0,0,.66);
  padding:8px 16px;border-radius:14px;font-size:14px;opacity:0;transition:opacity .3s}

/* ---------------- Inventory / Craft ---------------- */
#invGrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(9,46px);gap:5px;justify-content:center}
#catBar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
#catBtn{background:linear-gradient(#6fa9dd,#3f6f9e);color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:14px;padding:9px 16px;
  font-weight:800;font-size:14px;font-family:inherit;box-shadow:0 3px 0 #2b5075;cursor:pointer}
#catList{position:absolute;z-index:80;background:#1b2a3a;border-radius:16px;padding:8px;display:none;
  box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.6);max-height:60vh;overflow:auto}
#catList div{padding:9px 14px;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer}
#catList div:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.12)}
#craftGrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,52px);gap:6px}
#craftOut{width:60px;height:60px;border-radius:14px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);
  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(255,255,255,.2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.recipeList{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,74px);gap:8px;max-height:44vh;overflow:auto;padding:4px}
.recipe{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-radius:14px;padding:8px 4px;text-align:center;font-size:10px;cursor:pointer}
.recipe img{width:38px;height:38px;image-rendering:pixelated}
.recipe:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.18)}
.held{position:fixed;z-index:99;pointer-events:none;width:44px;height:44px;transform:translate(-50%,-50%)}
.held img{width:44px;height:44px;image-rendering:pixelated}
.helpText{max-width:640px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65}
.helpText code{background:rgba(255,255,255,.14);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:6px}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<canvas id='c'></canvas>

<!-- ============================ HUD ============================ -->
<div id='hud' class='hidden'>
  <div id='bars'>
    <div id='hearts' class='iconRow'></div>
    <div id='hungerRow' class='iconRow'></div>
  </div>
  <div id='meters'>
    <div class='meter'><b>NHIỆT ĐỘ</b><div class='track'><i id='tempFill'></i></div></div>
    <div class='meter'><b>NĂNG LƯỢNG</b><div class='track'><i id='energyFill'></i></div></div>
  </div>
  <div id='debug'></div>
  <div id='miniWrap'><canvas id='minimap' width='112' height='112'></canvas></div>
  <div id='crosshair'></div>
  <div id='hotbar'></div>
  <div id='leftBtns'>
    <div class='rbtn' id='btnBack'>◀</div>
    <div class='rbtn' id='btnBody'>☻</div>
    <div class='rbtn' id='btnCraft'>✋</div>
  </div>
  <div id='rightBtns'>
    <div class='rbtn' id='btnJump'>⤒</div>
    <div class='rbtn' id='btnCam'>◉</div>
    <div class='rbtn' id='btnMore'>⋯</div>
  </div>
  <div id='padLeft' class='pad'><div class='knob'></div></div>
  <div id='padRight' class='pad'><div class='knob'></div></div>
  <div id='toast'></div>
</div>

<!-- ======================== MAIN MENU ======================== -->
<div id='mainMenu' class='screen'>
  <div class='sky'></div><div class='clouds'></div>
  <div class='hill h1'></div><div class='hill h2'></div><div class='hill h3'></div><div class='hill h4'></div>
  <div id='logo'>SURVIVALCRAFT<span>2</span></div>
  <div class='menuBtns'>
    <button class='btn' id='mPlay'>Play</button>
    <button class='btn' id='mLoad'>Load World</button>
    <button class='btn' id='mComm'>Community Content</button>
    <button class='btn' id='mSet'>Settings</button>
    <button class='btn' id='mHelp'>Help</button>
    <button class='btn' id='mQuit'>Quit</button>
  </div>
  <div class='ver'>Web Clone v1.0 · Three.js · single-file</div>
</div>

<!-- ========================= PAUSE ========================= -->
<div id='pauseScreen' class='screen hidden'>
  <div class='panel'>
    <h2>PAUSED</h2>
    <div class='row'><button class='btn small' id='pReturn'>Return</button>
      <button class='btn small warn' id='pQuit'>Quit</button>
      <button class='btn small' id='pMore'>More [...]</button></div>
    <div id='pauseMore' class='row hidden' style='margin-top:14px'>
      <button class='btn small' id='pPlayers'>Edit Players</button>
      <button class='btn small' id='pSettings'>Settings</button>
      <button class='btn small' id='pHelp'>Help</button>
      <button class='btn small' id='pControls'>Controls</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ======================= INVENTORY ======================= -->
<div id='invScreen' class='screen hidden'>
  <div class='panel' style='position:relative'>
    <h2>INVENTORY</h2>
    <div id='catBar'><button id='catBtn'>All Blocks ▾</button></div>
    <div id='catList'></div>
    <div id='invGrid'></div>
    <div class='row' style='margin-top:14px'>
      <button class='btn small' id='invClose'>Close</button>
      <button class='btn small' id='invCraft'>Craft 2x2</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ========================= CRAFT ========================= -->
<div id='craftScreen' class='screen hidden'>
  <div class='panel'>
    <h2>HAND CRAFT (2x2)</h2>
    <div class='row' style='align-items:flex-start;gap:22px'>
      <div id='craftGrid'></div>
      <div style='font-size:30px;padding-top:12px'>➜</div>
      <div id='craftOut'></div>
    </div>
    <h2 style='margin-top:16px;font-size:16px'>RECIPES</h2>
    <div class='recipeList' id='recipeList'></div>
    <div class='row' style='margin-top:12px'><button class='btn small' id='craftClose'>Close</button></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ======================== SETTINGS ======================== -->
<div id='setScreen' class='screen hidden'>
  <div class='panel' style='min-width:340px'>
    <h2>SETTINGS</h2>
    <div class='row' style='justify-content:space-between'><span>Điều khiển</span>
      <button class='btn small' id='setCtrl'>Touchpad</button></div>
    <div class='row' style='justify-content:space-between'><span>Render distance</span>
      <button class='btn small' id='setRD'>6</button></div>
    <div class='row' style='justify-content:space-between'><span>Độ dài 1 năm (ngày)</span>
      <button class='btn small' id='setYear'>24</button></div>
    <div class='row' style='justify-content:space-between'><span>Âm thanh</span>
      <button class='btn small' id='setSnd'>On</button></div>
    <div class='row' style='justify-content:space-between'><span>Texture Pack (.png)</span>
      <input type='file' id='texPack' accept='image/png' style='max-width:150px;font-size:11px'></div>
    <div class='row' style='margin-top:14px'><button class='btn small' id='setClose'>Close</button></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ========================== BODY ========================== -->
<div id='bodyScreen' class='screen hidden'>
  <div class='panel'>
    <h2>BODY</h2>
    <div class='helpText'>
      <b>Trang phục:</b> <span id='bodyCloth'>Không</span><br>
      <b>Kỹ năng:</b> Mining, Crafting, Hunting, Farming<br>
      <b>Nhiệt độ cơ thể:</b> <span id='bodyTemp'>37.0</span>°C<br>
      <b>Máu:</b> <span id='bodyHp'>10</span>/10 · <b>Đói:</b> <span id='bodyFood'>10</span>/10
    </div>
    <div class='row' style='margin-top:14px'>
      <button class='btn small' id='bodyInv'>Inventory</button>
      <button class='btn small' id='bodyClose'>Close</button></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ========================== HELP ========================== -->
<div id='helpScreen' class='screen hidden'>
  <div class='panel'>
    <h2>HELP / CONTROLS</h2>
    <div class='helpText'>
      <b>Mobile (split touch):</b><br>
      • Touchpad trái: di chuyển · Tap 1 lần: nhảy<br>
      • Touchpad phải: xoay camera · Tap 1 lần: nhảy<br>
      • Chạm ngắn (short touch): đặt block / tương tác<br>
      • Chạm giữ (long touch): phá block<br>
      • Vuốt (drag) bất kỳ đâu: xoay camera<br><br>
      <b>PC:</b> <code>WASD</code> di chuyển, <code>Space</code> nhảy, <code>Chuột trái</code> phá,
      <code>Chuột phải</code> đặt, <code>E</code> inventory, <code>1-9</code> hotbar,
      <code>F</code> đổi góc nhìn, <code>ESC</code> pause.<br><br>
      <b>Texture pack:</b> Settings → chọn file PNG (mỗi block 16x16, atlas 8x8 ô = 128x128 px).
    </div>
    <div class='row' style='margin-top:14px'><button class='btn small' id='helpClose'>Close</button></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div id='held' class='held hidden'></div>

<script type='importmap'>
{ "imports": { "three": "https://unpkg.com/three@0.160.0/build/three.module.js" } }
</script>
